	(text "DESIGN NOTE:\nDelta FFB0412EN-00Y2E:\n	32.9 CFM, PWM, Tach\n	17.4 W, 1.45 A, 64 dBA\nSanyo Denki 9HVA0412P3J001:\n	37.1 CFM, PWM and Tach\n	31.2 W, 2.6 A, 71 dBA.\n	This is a tiny jet.\nSanyo Denki 9LG0412P3G001:\n	32.9 CFM, PWM/tach, very long specified life\n	22.8 W, 1.9 A, 68 dBA.\nDelta TFA0412CNP8:\n	22.24 CFM, 6 W, PWM/tach, IP68\n	Less cooling headroom, but much more reasonable at 54 dBA."
